WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:01:30.070 --> 00:01:32.910
<b>Battle of Monsters on Onigashima</b>

3
00:01:32.670 --> 00:01:36.920
You're still saying that?
I'll crush you!

4
00:01:36.920 --> 00:01:38.670
"King of the Pirates"?

5
00:01:38.670 --> 00:01:40.840
Don't make laugh.

6
00:01:49.850 --> 00:01:51.690
A new Haki.

7
00:01:51.690 --> 00:01:54.360
Must be the technique
that old man taught him.

8
00:01:54.360 --> 00:01:56.320
His punches can hurt Kaido.

9
00:01:56.320 --> 00:01:59.240
But there's gotta be a trick.
What the hell is it?

10
00:01:59.240 --> 00:02:03.120
We might just win this!

11
00:02:03.120 --> 00:02:06.080
That's nice and all,
but before I do anything,

12
00:02:06.080 --> 00:02:08.750
there's something I gotta
get straight with Straw Hat.

13
00:02:08.750 --> 00:02:11.090
Hey, shrimp!

14
00:02:12.170 --> 00:02:13.420
You don't even know
what it means

15
00:02:13.420 --> 00:02:14.920
to be King of the Pirates!

16
00:02:14.920 --> 00:02:17.090
It's not something
you take lightly!

17
00:02:17.090 --> 00:02:19.720
So stop running your mouth!

18
00:02:25.390 --> 00:02:27.650
I kicked his ass in Kuri.

19
00:02:27.650 --> 00:02:30.570
How did he get so much stronger?

20
00:02:33.440 --> 00:02:36.020
Few can stand up to me,

21
00:02:36.940 --> 00:02:40.980
and they are not to
be underestimated.

22
00:02:46.700 --> 00:02:50.160
I know you didn't
come here just to lose.

23
00:02:50.160 --> 00:02:54.250
Are you telling me you think
you're as good as them?

24
00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:57.670
Answer me, Straw Hat!

25
00:03:19.510 --> 00:03:21.520
it!

26
00:03:21.520 --> 00:03:24.810
I saw that one coming,
but he's fast!

27
00:03:24.810 --> 00:03:26.230
Well done!

28
00:03:26.230 --> 00:03:29.270
It's an improvement over
last time, if nothing else.

29
00:03:29.270 --> 00:03:31.860
C'mon, Kaido! Honestly?

30
00:03:31.860 --> 00:03:34.570
Trash is meant
to be incinerated!

31
00:03:34.900 --> 00:03:36.820
Prometheus!

32
00:03:36.820 --> 00:03:39.120
Yes, Mama?

33
00:03:39.120 --> 00:03:41.990
I'll burn you to ash, boy!

34
00:03:47.290 --> 00:03:50.420
Foxfire Style, Flame-Rend!

35
00:03:55.470 --> 00:03:58.470
He cut Prometheus right in half!

36
00:03:58.470 --> 00:03:58.580
That's Kin'emon's move!
Nice one, Zoro!

37
00:03:58.580 --> 00:03:59.350
That's

38
00:04:00.880 --> 00:04:03.960
move! Nice one, Zoro!

39
00:04:05.100 --> 00:04:08.670
I stole it.

40
00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:11.610
I'm gonna make you pay!

41
00:04:11.610 --> 00:04:14.570
Huh? Don't lower
your guard, Luffy!

42
00:04:15.260 --> 00:04:18.400
You're dealing
with two Emperors!

43
00:04:22.600 --> 00:04:24.230
Shambles.

44
00:04:34.840 --> 00:04:36.970
Straw Hat, get up.

45
00:04:36.970 --> 00:04:40.300
Traffy! Thanks! You saved me!

46
00:04:42.430 --> 00:04:44.230
Cuz there's something
you and I need to get straight!

47
00:04:44.230 --> 00:04:45.270
Huh?

48
00:04:45.270 --> 00:04:46.980
Those samurai.

49
00:04:46.980 --> 00:04:49.230
I was gonna teleport them
to safety anyway

50
00:04:49.230 --> 00:04:51.630
before you said
a damn word to me!

51
00:04:51.630 --> 00:04:52.760
Huh?

52
00:04:52.760 --> 00:04:55.090
But you just had to bark orders!

53
00:04:55.090 --> 00:04:58.340
Traffy! Move them
all downstairs!

54
00:05:00.600 --> 00:05:02.640
Do you know
how that made me look?

55
00:05:02.640 --> 00:05:05.350
Taking orders from you
like a damn subordinate?!

56
00:05:05.350 --> 00:05:08.940
Huh? Why would anyone
care about that?

57
00:05:09.510 --> 00:05:11.770
That's the idea, right?

58
00:05:11.770 --> 00:05:15.640
You followed Straw Hat's orders
to show your loyalty to him?

59
00:05:15.640 --> 00:05:17.810
Huh? Of course not!

60
00:05:17.810 --> 00:05:20.020
Just a loser
with a loser underling.

61
00:05:20.020 --> 00:05:22.240
You two were
made for each other.

62
00:05:23.490 --> 00:05:25.990
You're the loser,
you big, stupid jerk!

63
00:05:25.990 --> 00:05:27.700
Was that directed at me?

64
00:05:27.700 --> 00:05:30.240
You can squabble on
your own damn time!

65
00:05:30.240 --> 00:05:31.540
– Huh?!
– Huh?!

66
00:05:33.200 --> 00:05:35.120
Scorch 'em, Prometheus!

67
00:05:35.120 --> 00:05:36.790
Yes, Mama!

68
00:05:36.790 --> 00:05:38.840
Heavenly Bon-Bons!

69
00:05:43.130 --> 00:05:45.220
'Kay, here's the deal!

70
00:05:46.430 --> 00:05:50.220
The first person who
dodges her attack loses!

71
00:05:50.220 --> 00:05:52.140
Who would agree to that crap?

72
00:05:52.140 --> 00:05:53.220
You're a grown-ass man,

73
00:05:53.220 --> 00:05:55.350
and you're still
pulling this nonsense?

74
00:05:55.350 --> 00:05:57.150
Go ahead and die!

75
00:05:57.150 --> 00:05:59.900
You don't have what it takes
to make it with real pirates!

76
00:05:59.900 --> 00:06:02.780
Fine, then!
You're losers and I win!

77
00:06:02.780 --> 00:06:04.570
– Huh?
– Huh?

78
00:06:04.570 --> 00:06:06.860
Whatever. Suit yourselves.

79
00:06:06.860 --> 00:06:08.530
I'm not playing.

80
00:06:08.530 --> 00:06:10.580
But if you're not playing, then
why are you still standing here?

81
00:06:10.580 --> 00:06:12.580
Yeah, you wusses. Just go.

82
00:06:15.040 --> 00:06:17.250
Hey! Watch out!

83
00:06:28.250 --> 00:06:30.130
Why did you all
just stand there?!

84
00:06:30.130 --> 00:06:34.890
What a pity!

85
00:06:34.890 --> 00:06:37.680
So much for being
King of the Pirates!

86
00:06:37.680 --> 00:06:39.720
Now, the fun part!

87
00:06:39.720 --> 00:06:43.850
How am I gonna murder
you rotten brats? Huh?

88
00:06:43.850 --> 00:06:45.970
Gimme a sec, Linlin.

89
00:06:45.970 --> 00:06:48.570
I wanna see how strong
these kids are.

90
00:06:48.570 --> 00:06:52.610
Hm? That seems like
a waste of time.

91
00:06:54.060 --> 00:06:56.860
You stay back,
"Hitokiri Kamazo."

92
00:06:59.110 --> 00:07:01.150
You think that mask fooled me?

93
00:07:01.150 --> 00:07:03.360
I'd know that laugh anywhere.

94
00:07:05.600 --> 00:07:07.050
If I'd had these Punishers

95
00:07:07.050 --> 00:07:08.390
with me when we fought,

96
00:07:08.390 --> 00:07:12.350
you'd be dead, Zorojuro.

97
00:07:12.390 --> 00:07:14.350
I seriously doubt that.

98
00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:08.630
It's not enough.

99
00:08:16.340 --> 00:08:18.220
That wasn't half bad!

100
00:08:18.220 --> 00:08:21.350
I need to unleash a little
more of your power, Enma.

101
00:08:21.350 --> 00:08:22.850
What do you say?

102
00:08:23.230 --> 00:08:24.500
Kaido!

103
00:08:26.500 --> 00:08:29.440
We're gonna finish you
in one shot!

104
00:11:06.190 --> 00:11:08.970
Each of you a monster
in your own right.

105
00:11:08.970 --> 00:11:09.030
Just as it should be!

106
00:11:09.030 --> 00:11:10.810
As it should be!

107
00:11:10.810 --> 00:11:13.350
Let's see if you
have what it takes

108
00:11:13.350 --> 00:11:15.600
to be King of the Pirates!

109
00:11:15.600 --> 00:11:17.400
I won't hold back!

110
00:11:47.600 --> 00:11:51.640
That stung.
Not a bad start!

111
00:11:51.970 --> 00:11:55.140
I probably couldn't

112
00:11:55.140 --> 00:11:57.230
break through your
thick skin if I tried!

113
00:11:57.230 --> 00:11:58.940
But that doesn't mean I can't

114
00:11:58.940 --> 00:12:02.280
crush you to death
with enough pressure!

115
00:12:06.910 --> 00:12:08.620
You wanna see me at my worst?

116
00:12:08.620 --> 00:12:11.870
I'm happy to give you
a front row seat!

117
00:12:30.050 --> 00:12:33.100
That's not bad.

118
00:12:33.100 --> 00:12:36.390
But it needs more mass
to seal the deal.

119
00:12:42.940 --> 00:12:45.820
More mass? Let's try this, then!

120
00:12:45.820 --> 00:12:46.820
What the hell?

121
00:12:46.820 --> 00:12:48.450
Now, Takt!

122
00:12:50.280 --> 00:12:51.830
Crap!

123
00:13:02.880 --> 00:13:04.380
You bastard!

124
00:13:04.380 --> 00:13:07.130
You were gonna take me out,
too, weren't you?

125
00:13:07.900 --> 00:13:13.320
Damn, that hurt.

126
00:13:13.320 --> 00:13:15.910
You're really trying to bury me.

127
00:13:17.990 --> 00:13:19.990
I remember that feeling.

128
00:13:29.540 --> 00:13:32.630
Reminds me of
the good old days.

129
00:13:37.760 --> 00:13:39.300
Yummy yum!

130
00:13:39.300 --> 00:13:42.020
All charged and ready to go!

131
00:13:48.900 --> 00:13:51.020
Here I thought
you were all talk!

132
00:13:51.020 --> 00:13:52.740
That wasn't half bad!

133
00:13:52.740 --> 00:13:55.740
If you're crazy enough
to aim for King of the Pirates,

134
00:13:55.740 --> 00:13:58.220
that's the least I can expect.

135
00:14:01.490 --> 00:14:01.650
And yet, none of you
have any hope of stopping me.

136
00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:06.200
And yet none of you have
any hope of stopping me!

137
00:14:19.220 --> 00:14:21.560
Almost breaks my heart.

138
00:14:21.560 --> 00:14:23.350
You've come this far,

139
00:14:23.350 --> 00:14:26.270
but you'll all be dead
in no time at all.

140
00:14:35.820 --> 00:14:39.780
And I'll take so much
more than just your life.

141
00:14:39.780 --> 00:14:42.870
Like any good pirate,
I'll take all your crew members

142
00:14:42.870 --> 00:14:44.790
who followed you here.

143
00:14:47.120 --> 00:14:49.880
No way in hell.
I'll never let you!

144
00:14:52.290 --> 00:14:54.590
Not just
your crew members.

145
00:14:54.590 --> 00:14:56.720
We'll take all of
your treasures, too!

146
00:14:56.720 --> 00:14:59.010
You've got some
Poneglyphs, right?

147
00:14:59.010 --> 00:15:01.890
A fair prize for
what you put me through!

148
00:15:01.890 --> 00:15:04.470
I can't wait!

149
00:15:05.520 --> 00:15:07.140
Didn't think about treasure!

150
00:15:07.140 --> 00:15:09.560
I'd be happy to take yours!

151
00:15:12.560 --> 00:15:16.320
Whoever wins this battle
will be one step closer

152
00:15:16.320 --> 00:15:18.950
to being King of the Pirates!

153
00:15:20.200 --> 00:15:22.530
Yeah, you're right about that.

154
00:15:22.530 --> 00:15:24.700
And it's gonna be me!

155
00:15:52.100 --> 00:15:54.350
<b>Demolition Gust</b>

156
00:16:16.260 --> 00:16:18.560
They were just scraps, anyway!

157
00:16:22.350 --> 00:16:24.730
Kaido!

158
00:16:30.150 --> 00:16:33.360
You idiots will never
be King of the Pirates,

159
00:16:33.360 --> 00:16:36.700
but at least you can
entertain me before you die.

160
00:16:42.730 --> 00:16:45.030
The Land of Wano is mine!

161
00:16:45.030 --> 00:16:48.160
I will bring a new era!

162
00:16:51.320 --> 00:16:54.180
Can you carry
the weight for me?

163
00:16:55.680 --> 00:16:58.580
Will you deliver this country?

164
00:17:16.640 --> 00:17:19.560
Wano doesn't belong to you!

165
00:17:20.060 --> 00:17:25.440
Gum-Gum Kong Rifle!

166
00:17:37.830 --> 00:17:40.210
Takin' a nap, Mister Emperor?

167
00:17:40.210 --> 00:17:42.840
Then this is your wake-up call!

168
00:17:54.470 --> 00:17:59.850
Slam Gibson!

169
00:18:10.530 --> 00:18:14.700
Now, Room! And Shambles!

170
00:18:20.540 --> 00:18:23.880
Never seen an anatomical
chart of a dragon before.

171
00:18:29.880 --> 00:18:33.090
But your heart should be here!

172
00:18:34.100 --> 00:18:35.970
Gamma Knife!

173
00:18:43.190 --> 00:18:44.900
If I can't beat you
from the outside,

174
00:18:44.900 --> 00:18:46.480
I'll do it from within!

175
00:18:49.420 --> 00:18:55.300
You're quite the pest!

176
00:19:02.810 --> 00:19:05.040
Seems you've done your research.

177
00:19:05.040 --> 00:19:07.250
If you know how durable I am,

178
00:19:07.500 --> 00:19:10.760
maybe you're not as stupid
as I thought you were.

179
00:19:13.010 --> 00:19:16.430
Those scales of yours
are a real pain in the ass.

180
00:19:17.060 --> 00:19:20.020
But I know a trick
to get inside, too!

181
00:19:26.360 --> 00:19:30.570
Scyther!

182
00:19:30.570 --> 00:19:32.200
Sonic!

183
00:19:43.460 --> 00:19:49.290
That one hurt,
didn't it? Now die!

184
00:19:49.290 --> 00:19:50.960
Indra!

185
00:20:00.930 --> 00:20:04.520
As long as you're under
the open sky, you're my prey!

186
00:20:04.520 --> 00:20:07.810
You didn't think you could
escape from me, did you?

187
00:20:08.620 --> 00:20:13.050
I admit, my expectations
weren't exactly high,

188
00:20:13.050 --> 00:20:14.720
but this has been fun!

189
00:20:14.720 --> 00:20:17.590
Rhino Schneider!

190
00:20:23.790 --> 00:20:27.210
Look at you! Not bad!

191
00:20:33.920 --> 00:20:37.010
Hey, Traffy!
Teleport me up there, and hurry!

192
00:20:38.160 --> 00:20:40.180
What? I'm not a moving service!

193
00:20:40.180 --> 00:20:42.480
And I don't take
orders from you!

194
00:20:43.850 --> 00:20:45.520
I'll do it 'cause I want to!

195
00:20:45.520 --> 00:20:48.110
Not because you told me to!

196
00:20:48.110 --> 00:20:50.400
Foxfire Style.

197
00:20:55.490 --> 00:20:58.870
Blast Breath!

198
00:21:04.870 --> 00:21:06.830
Flame-Rend!

199
00:21:12.880 --> 00:21:14.630
Thanks, Zoro!

200
00:21:15.640 --> 00:21:17.140
Let's try again!

201
00:21:18.550 --> 00:21:20.060
Traffy!

202
00:21:20.430 --> 00:21:22.600
Ha? I told you.

203
00:21:22.600 --> 00:21:25.690
Stop acting like you're
my boss, damn it!

204
00:21:28.100 --> 00:21:29.270
Huh?

205
00:21:32.740 --> 00:21:34.780
What the hell?

206
00:21:34.780 --> 00:21:38.030
Hm? Out of the way, Kaido!

207
00:21:38.030 --> 00:21:41.370
That's no ordinary
weapon he's got!

208
00:21:41.740 --> 00:21:44.160
One-Sword Style!

209
00:21:53.920 --> 00:21:56.930
Flying Dragon Blaze!

210
00:22:07.940 --> 00:22:10.270
What is this power I feel?

211
00:22:10.690 --> 00:22:12.860
Why is Oden's presence
in his sword?

212
00:22:12.860 --> 00:22:15.720
Damn it. I missed!

213
00:22:15.720 --> 00:22:18.760
This is what you get
for taking us lightly.

214
00:22:18.760 --> 00:22:20.640
Indra!

215
00:22:26.400 --> 00:22:28.440
No. Zoro!

216
00:22:32.400 --> 00:22:35.280
Look at that.
All lined up for me!

217
00:22:37.530 --> 00:22:42.280
God of Lightning Tenjin,
heed my call!

218
00:22:48.330 --> 00:22:51.630
That woman is a living calamity!

219
00:23:25.410 --> 00:23:26.710
Hm? What in the hell?

220
00:23:26.710 --> 00:23:28.420
What in the hell?!

221
00:23:28.420 --> 00:23:30.130
How did you survive
all that lightning

222
00:23:30.130 --> 00:23:32.380
without a scratch on you?

223
00:23:38.760 --> 00:23:41.800
'Cause I'm a rubber man!

224
00:23:45.350 --> 00:23:48.730
You're gonna pay for
hurting my friends!

225
00:23:51.060 --> 00:23:52.020
Blast

226
00:24:23.600 --> 00:24:23.730
Fire doesn't
work either. Why not?

227
00:24:23.730 --> 00:24:25.560
Fire doesn't work either.

228
00:24:25.560 --> 00:24:27.480
Why the hell not?
